.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trellis-ci 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis\-ci \- Structured output for CI
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis ci\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Structured output for CI
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
trellis\-ci\-matrix(1)
Emit a GitHub Actions strategy matrix: {"include":[{name,path,version},…]}
.TP
trellis\-ci\-outputs(1)
Emit workspace facts as key=value lines for $GITHUB_OUTPUT
.TP
trellis\-ci\-tag\-package(1)
Resolve a pushed tag (e.g. $GITHUB_REF_NAME) to its package name
